silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_02_typed_legs_and_atlas_sections_04_diagram_inventory_table_concrete_anchor_0#pullback_joc_s1120 silm:hasLongDescription "The Pullback_JoC_S1120 is the pullback construction P = X times_Z Y from JoC 11.20; instantiated by the (BodyMass-quality, WeighingProcedure) fiber product over an Observation outcome. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Pullback_JoC_S1120', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
